	(text "Pin order on the FPGA follows the board (pinmap.py): row pins 2-26 <- bank 1,\nUDQM + DQ8-15 around the top end (bank 0 / 1), A4-A12 + CKE + CLK around the bottom end (bank 1 / 2).\n100 MHz CL2: PLL-clocked I/O, SD_CLK from the PLL (phase-shifted), 22 R at the FPGA.\nF.Cu only, 50 ohm over In1 GND: row lines about 15 mm, the wraps up to about 60 mm (0.3 ns skew, decision 16)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 459.74 140.97 0)
